# UI

Raw `className` strings belong to the design system (`src/packages/ui-primitives`,
`src/shared/components/primitives`) and to `*.variants.ts` / `*.constants.ts`
files. Everywhere else, import a class bundle.

User-facing text comes from the message catalog by key. A literal string in a
component fails lint.

A client component must carry a `// client-boundary-reason:` comment saying
what browser-only capability it needs. "It felt easier" is not one.

Every interactive control is reachable and operable by keyboard. Where a gesture
would be the obvious implementation — reordering, for instance — use buttons.
